      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d942fda314329981e621b9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让您久等了～。合适吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4c5b502e5da3e1cc8d89770cc0d53ba17e19501f5edbbe0bbda5bbea56e0959",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b98fd2f61f34828307c0d51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有没有穿得很合身呢…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "44201a5ba62da84f436b83dd0b60fc1e5224ec1e654f0622ac8c1aa120a056a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e023cf018acb7cc7673fc7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:842e5b440601a39a8d63c6d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，早上好。\r\n早饭有好好吃吗？\r\n如果想吃我这里有一小块奶酪哦",
      "source_fingerprint": "feab2bac577d9f278af1951d63ccebebb5a55de281f536c7ef842c292c04b322",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af386d25218c8ad935cae8ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『这是安全又干净的实验哦～！』\r\n……这，这样可以吗？有没有按照小速子\r\n的请求宣传好…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4804e0b2921e39501d997bdf2f3d41ef8212ccf72e61b012edd2fd0762789077",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "900004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b6ba6554767709c6ee93d13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那～个，这样就结束了！\r\n诶嘿嘿，辛苦了～！\r\n那～么，该收拾收拾了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c85fe25d2c16679a735ed2fe180db14f3821ad7971a209d1ecb628a62627879c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "900005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e29ac1076f3da86ff2ba9b6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像帮上忙了\r\n真是太好了。…研究的内容\r\n我其实不太懂就是了～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5a523475b4aa8b22f82df0d440d8081b0f372539c6e2a82e178529f49a866ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "900006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b49f361e297bced11c4adec8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这份报告……写了很多\r\n有帮助的内容哦！\r\n要不要读读看～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "444b11e49ab57a9f4a0d4f4d292c6f0cf679d7ab0490d3dcab9d684d9b33bb44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "900007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fda6d8af198fae73afc4474",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是什么，看到别人在努力\r\n就会想给她加油呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "349dd1579dacbcd4b0d54fcb353d74a79bb6b003785c53917e13723d34b388a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "900008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e864b7d2e4ae740dc2f3bd07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我该认真时也会认真的！\r\n……接下来就希望结果\r\n也能跟上～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16eb55fd8473b85ad08ebe623a6b60f4d7e5db30aac4fc8d07a34731a9a87a11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "900009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ab5ddd928ef61e4ffac6d26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难道您困了……吗？唔～，怎么办\n……对了！我们跟着广播体操的\n视频一起做怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe03fd5136d6c5137f65a76986cf79e9c04ebebcf62f0a2e33ea630748112afd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
